    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4233" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἇλιξ</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἧλιξ</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλιξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐκος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>groats of rice-wheat</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζέα</span>), Chrysipp.Tyan. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.647d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				18.112
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			= Lat. <i>hallec, fish-sauce</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.148
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				20.46.2
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλίξαντος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i>worn by sea</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοιράδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.89
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Maec.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύμβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(1).878
				</span></i>
			 (Corcyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ. μόρος</span> death
				<i>by being dashed on the beach,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.404
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Zon.
			</span></i>).</div>
